OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fdry with evening sunshine followed by
OL,7,Fclear spells overnight. However, a few
OL,8,Fpatches of low cloud and some hill fog
OL,9,Fis likely to reform by the morning.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FSome inland hilly areas are
OL,12,Flikely to hold onto rather cloudy
OL,13,Fskies on Wednesday. It will be mostly
OL,14,Fdry though, and southern parts will
OL,15,Fsee some hot sunshine at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
